      "body": "Task 12991 / issue #1161. A configured opencode-go result carrying the OpenCode Go no-active-subscription signal maps to `lapsed`, propagates to its workspace pool, and survives quota ingest as a terminal non-error state with no stale percentages presented as current. Lapsed-only runs bypass failed-read retention; mixed runs preserve lapsed workspaces while retaining unaffected failed siblings.\n\nVerification on head `9b4b6b85692ae6df21395528e87821cecd154667`: `bun test test/quota-gather-map.test.ts test/quota-current.test.ts test/gather-quota.test.ts test/digest.test.ts test/feed.test.ts test/credential-lifecycle.test.ts` — 210 passed, 0 failed. GitHub checks are pending.",
