      "body": "## What\n\n`isDnsSection` (`pm-stack/aggregator/src/dns.ts`) was hardened by #2412 to require finite `totalAnnualListUsd` / entry `priceUsd`, but neither money field was bounded below — a negative finite total or entry price passed the gate, rendered as negative spend (`$-999.00` rows, negative `/yr` total), and was appended to snapshot records.\n\nThis PR adds the lower bound:\n\n- `totalAnnualListUsd >= 0` in `isDnsSection`\n- present `priceUsd >= 0` (null/absent stays valid, unchanged)\n\n## Tests\n\nNew regression test beside the #2412 cases in `pm-stack/aggregator/test/slice3.test.ts` (\"isDnsSection rejects negative money, allows zero (#4226)\"): negative total (-999, -0.01) rejected, negative entry price rejected, zero total / zero price / null price controls stay valid.\n\n- Targeted: `bun test test/slice3.test.ts` — 32/32 pass.\n- Full aggregator suite: 1161 pass; `test/brief-surfaces.test.ts` failure is pre-existing on clean main (verified by stashing this change: same 1 fail) and unrelated to dns.ts.\n\nQueue task 6378 · Closes #4226\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796230704&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=4468&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F4468&signature=b54784b7fb5166a3db837b9db2e8f6284d1d91fab9cc174ed8b98b363ce25577\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/4468?auto