      "body": "# Aggregator: align the projector reader with Session J's landed schema\n\nFollow-up to #856 (merged). Session J's projector landed in #859 with a\nwire schema that differs from the sketch this aggregator was built\nagainst. This PR aligns the aggregator's data layer with the actual\ncontract (`pm-stack/projector/schema.sql`). **New branch** —\n`pm/aggregator-ui` is dead after the #856 merge.\n\n## What changed\n\n- **Wire → read-model mapping** in `src/sources/live.ts`\n  (`mapProjectorItem` / `mapProjectorComment` /\n  `parseProjectorLabels`): snake_case fields, `state` is only\n  `open|closed` with `merged` as a separate 0/1 flag (merged wins),\n  `labels`/`assignees` are JSON array **strings** (parsed, tolerant of\n  junk), `created_at` / `review_state`, 0/1 `deleted` tombstones\n  dropped.\n- **Percent-encode refs in query strings** — refs contain `#`, which\n  would otherwise start a URL fragment and the projector would never\n  see the issue number. (Real bug caught by aligning to the actual\n  service.)\n- **Registry links are now consumed**: board cards and roadmap rows are\n  enriched with `GET /links?subject=…`, unioned with Kaneo external\n  links / text refs — this is the cross-repo link requirement Kaneo\n  cannot provide.\n- **Subjects**: `kaneo:<projectSlug>/<taskId>` (slug, not project\n  name), with the slug→repo map from `pm-stack/kaneo-projects.json`\n  (Session H: `nix` is `dezren39/nix`).\n- **`PM_PROJECTOR_URL` defaults to `http://127.0.0.1:7801`** (J's\n  service); `off` disables it.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `bun test` — **28 pass** (new `test/projector.test.ts`: mapping unit\n  tests + a stub-server test proving refs survive the query string).\n- `bunx tsc --noEmit` — clean.\n- **End-to-end against J's real projector service**: ran\n  `pm-stack/projector` on a temp DB (`/tmp`, seeded one item/comment/\n  link through its own tables), aggregator in live mode rendered the\n  seeded PR as `merged` with parsed labels, and the drill-down rendered\n  the seeded review; footer reported `items: live (projector)` /\n  `comments: live (projector)`.\n\nRead-only throughout: the aggregator still never writes to GitHub,\nKaneo, Pad, or Grist, and never POSTs/DELETEs registry links.\n\nDesign issues referenced by #856: **#851** (quota + throughput),\n**#852** (needs-you). No schema change needed for those views — quota\nand attention remain fixture-backed until their feeds are projected.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/862?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-light-v3.svg\"><img alt=\"View with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3-3x.png\" width=\"162\" height=\"28\"></picture></a> <a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1795511234&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=862&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F862&signature=0ffa7cea0c2cf847ce67714742df20a9ea5ac580a0847926ce7589e1d4559239\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup>Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Board and roadmap views can now include live registry links, item states, and comments from the projector.\n  * Registry links are combined with existing links without duplicates, and unknown link relations are shown as “relates.”\n  * Project names now map to configured GitHub repositories, with a fallback based on the project slug.\n* **Improvements**\n  * If projector data is unavailable, board and roadmap facets can fall back independently to existing data sources.\n  * Set `PM_PROJECTOR_URL=off` or `none` to disable projector access; otherwise, the default projector address is used.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
